{{Term/Store|See Enemy HP||Series, BotW}} is an [[Added Effect]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 280}}</ref>

==Overview==    
See Enemy HP is a hidden [[Added Effect]] that causes numerical [[Health]] values to be displayed above the [[Life Gauge]]s of [[Enemy|Enemies]]. It also causes Enemy Life Gauges to be automatically displayed once [[Link]] is close enough, instead of only when the Enemy has taken damage.

The following [[Armor]] pieces grant See Enemy HP in {{BotW}}:
* [[Champion's Tunic]]
* [[Vah Medoh Divine Helm]]
* [[Vah Naboris Divine Helm]]
* [[Vah Rudania Divine Helm]]
* [[Vah Ruta Divine Helm]]

